 <html lang="en">
 <head>
   <meta charset="utf-8" />
   <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
+  <meta name="description" content="Amarbir Singh — Software Engineer, open-source builder, and AI enthusiast based in Canada. View projects, skills, and get in touch." />
